  "merger_description": "Woolworths Group Limited (**Woolworths**) is an Australian public company (**ASX: WOW**) that primarily:\n\n* operates supermarkets nationwide as Woolworths or Woolworths Metro, and\n* purchases or leases of land through its wholly owned subsidiary, Fabcot Pty Ltd (**Fabcot**).\n\nThe vendors of the site are private individuals. [Names of the landholders are withheld under section 5-3 of the *Competition and Consumer (Notification of Acquisitions) Determination 2025 (Cth)*].\n\nWoolworths, via its subsidiary, Fabcot, proposes to acquire a freehold interest in 158-162 Homestead Road, Orchard Hills, NSW (the\u00a0**Acquisition**). The target site is located in a residential area.\n\nWoolworths proposes to construct a new neighbourhood centre which would include a Woolworths supermarket which is anticipated to open in July 2033.",
